## Status

Draft after parallel red-team pass.

This plan turns the agreed Anvil Brain direction into the first production-grade implementation slice.

## Goal

Add an Anvil MCP first-run path that lets an agent discover Anvil status, see that Brain setup is required, create its own Brain workspace through an explicit setup tool, and then use `llm-wiki` MCP to read the Brain wiki contract/context.

The first version should make Brain real without implementing the full Brain automation layer.

```text
anvil_session_bootstrap
  -> reports Brain missing or configured
  -> suggests exact setup/registration calls

anvil_brain_setup
  -> explicitly creates user-level Anvil config/state
  -> prepares a Brain setup brief for the agent
  -> routes the agent to the existing /wikime / llm-wiki scaffold path

anvil_session_bootstrap
  -> reports Brain configured and ready for wiki context calls
```

## Non-Goals

- Do not implement Continuity-to-Brain synthesis yet.
